{58}{Business?  Oh, I suppose its never outstanding here in Shrouded Hills...we're a small town, and a simple folk.  But, to be honest, I've had trouble getting my hands on any good ore for smithing...its hard to bring up anything out of the old Bessie Toone...}{Business?  Oh, I suppose its never outstanding here in Shrouded Hills...we're a small town, and a simple folk.  But, to be honest, I've had trouble getting my hands on any good ore for smithing...its hard to bring up anything out of the old Bessie Toone...}{}{}{}{}
