{63}{The Bessie Toone is an old silver mine, just north and a little west of town, and I own it.  There hasn't been silver down there for a long time, but they'll still bring up some iron ore every once in a while.  Lately the miners have been pretty spooked...I guess old Bessie is a wanderin' her mine again...}{The Bessie Toone is an old silver mine, just north and a little west of town, and I own it.  There hasn't been silver down there for a long time, but they'll still bring up some iron ore every once in a while.  Lately the miners have been pretty spooked...I guess old Bessie is a wanderin' her mine again...}{}{}{}{}
